## 8 · Security re-verification follow-up — L2 pinned pre-RS1a authors-less digest

Product change under test: the A2 fold in
`mapper/reqharness/config.py::canonical_config` (the pinned digest constant
`PRE_RS1A_AUTHORS_LESS_DIGEST = fa46d573143f51637e87721b6f7d9fe91b8cfd3c00be9bf8e8f66daf4b09074b`,
computed from `git show 05c516a~1:mapper/reqharness/config.py` loaded as a
separate module over the seeded config).

Mutation (position/operation): `if config.authors:` → `if True:` (always fold
`authors`, so the authors-less digest drifts away from the pre-RS1a value).

```text
$ pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tests/test_reqharness_registry.py::test_an_authors_less_config_hashes_byte_identically_to_today
FAILED … AssertionError: assert 'authors' not in {'authors': {}, …}
1 failed in 0.35s
```

Restore: sha256 `before=ce397107…185c after=ce397107…185c` → `EQUAL`.

```text
$ pytest -q -p no:cacheprovider tests/test_reqharness_registry.py::test_an_authors_less_config_hashes_byte_identically_to_today
1 passed in 0.25s
```

